[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18901.51, "timestamp": "05:15:01", "text": "而现在的问题是，由于太阳……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18903.03, "timestamp": "05:15:03", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18905.59, "timestamp": "05:15:05", "text": "是的，342.8 80。等等，等等，等等。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18908.15, "timestamp": "05:15:08", "text": "剩下的就是这些了。好的。我付了31。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18911.59, "timestamp": "05:15:11", "text": "是367几几。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18913.99, "timestamp": "05:15:13", "text": "我拿到了教师资格证。不，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18917.59, "timestamp": "05:15:17", "text": "七折。不，是 30% 减去 30,000。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18924.23, "timestamp": "05:15:24", "text": "所以，通常的正常汇率是 64 美元 649 美元，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18926.07, "timestamp": "05:15:26", "text": "但由于教育许可证，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18930.47, "timestamp": "05:15:30", "text": "我花了369多块钱买的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18933.51, "timestamp": "05:15:33", "text": "所以大概30岁左右"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18937.43, "timestamp": "05:15:37", "text": "是的，可能是人际差异之类的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18939.75, "timestamp": "05:15:39", "text": "嗨，总之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18943.91, "timestamp": "05:15:43", "text": "之后。是的。无法保存"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18946.708, "timestamp": "05:15:46", "text": "什"}]